## Installing

Download the latest build from [Releases](https://github.com/__REPO__/releases):

- **Linux** — unpack `__SLUG__-<version>-linux-x86_64.tar.gz` and run `./install.sh`.
- **Windows** — unpack `__SLUG__-<version>-windows-x86_64.zip` and run `__SLUG__.exe`.

From source on Linux: `./install.sh` builds and installs it for your user.

## Development

```bash
cargo run
cargo test
cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings
cargo run -- --emit-icon packaging/__SLUG__.svg
cargo run -- --emit-ico packaging/__SLUG__.ico
```

Releases: publish a release named `vX.Y.Z` on GitHub (or push the tag) and the release workflow attaches the Linux and Windows builds.

